nd thank you for joining us.","In the first three months of the year, we delivered operational sales growth of 6.4%.","Across each of our six key businesses: Oncology, Immunology, Neuroscience, Cardiovascular, Surgery, and Vision, we have multiple differentiated assets to drive sustained growth and a strong competitive advantage.","Our unique combination of Innovative Medicine and MedTech, together with strong execution and industry-leading investment in innovation, is delivering resilient growth.","CARVYKTI, TECVAYLI, and TALVEY also continue to deliver high double-digit growth reflecting the importance of our multiple myeloma portfolio across the full treatment journey.","That positions the regimen as a potential new standard of care as early as second line.","In solid tumors, RYBREVANT FASPRO received FDA approval for subcutaneous monthly dosing for patients with EGFR mutated non-small cell lung cancer.","Together, ICOTYDE and TREMFYA create a complementary category shaping portfolio.","In heart recovery, Abiomed had another strong quarter as did Shockwave in circulatory restoration.","And in electrophysiology, VARIPULSE our pulsed field ablation platform for atrial fibrillation keeps building momentum.","And finally, we recently announced 12-month data for OMNYPULSE, our large focal-tip PFA catheter, showing positive outcomes, no safety events, and 100% procedural success rate.","In Q1, we made progress on our OTTAVA robotic surgical system, and we are building on our recent De Novo filing for approval with a second Investigational Device Exemption trial now underway for inguinal hernia repair.","In Vision, we are restoring sight to its healthiest state with expanding access globally for our ACUVUE OASYS MAX disposable lenses for presbyopia and astigmatism and our TECNIS intraocular lenses."],"x":[0,46,29,5,1,1,4,4,5,1,40,29,8,1,3,6,8,8,9,11,12,2,47,32,13,0,2,2,3,3,4,7,9,10,10,11,12,12,3,33,24,6,1,1,2,3,4,5,4,26,21,6,1,2,10,11,11,12,5,29,22,9,2,3,4,9,10,11,11,12