},{"id":"jnj-jnj-usq-transcript-2025-10-14","date":"2025-10-14","type":"remarks","title":"Q3 2025 Earnings Call: CEO Prepared Remarks","location":"s203.q4cdn.com","url":"https://s203.q4cdn.com/636242992/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/16/JNJ-USQ_Transcript_2025-10-14.pdf","words":1699,"n_sentences":81,"year":"2025","s":["Thank you, Darren, and hello, everyone.","These are areas where we have deep expertise and clear leadership positions.","First, Oncology, where Q3 operational sales grew nearly 20%.","Take multiple myeloma, where our competitiveness is unrivaled.","I also want to say a word about CARVYKTI, our CAR-T treatment for multiple myeloma.","Inlexzo highlights what is unique about Johnson & Johnson.","And in lung cancer, we recently published results in the New England Journal of Medicine for RYBREVANT plus LAZCLUZE, showing a statistically significant reduction in the risk of death compared to osimertinib.","We are now seeing the potential for patients to live significantly longer than anyone thought possible.","We have long talked about TREMFYA as the next big innovation to follow the success of Stelara.","TREMFYA is the only IL-23 inhibitor to offer a fully subcutaneous regimen across ulcerative colitis and Crohn's disease.","Historically, the most effective Immunology treatments have been injectables.","SPRAVATO remains the only approved stand-alone therapy for treatment-resistant depression, a major depressive disorder with suicidal ideation.","We project CAPLYTA to reach $5 billion annually.","In fact, in the last quarter, Shockwave supported their 1 millionth patient, and with the recent European approval of the Javelin Peripheral Intravascular Lithotripsy Catheter, we expect strong momentum moving forward.","We anticipate Shockwave becoming our 13th billion dollar MedTech platform by year end.","In the 10-year DanGer Shock study, routine use of Impella CP in patients who have had a heart attack with cardiogenic shock reduced mortality by 16.3% compared to the standard of care, with patients gaining an average of 600 additional days alive.","Our surgical technologies are used in most operating rooms globally, and in Q3, we delivered more than 9% growth in biosurgery and almost 7% in wound closure, driven by accelerating adoption of our latest innovations.","We also continue to make positive progress with OTTAVA, as we anticipate FDA de novo submission in early 2026.","And after launching the world's first multifocal contact lens for people with astigmatism in the US last quarter, we brought this latest member of the ACUVUE OASYS Max 1-Day family to Europe and Korea in Q3, further strengthening our momentum.","And finally, to this morning's Orthopaedics news.","As you know, the healthcare industry continues to evolve rapidly, and we are constantly evaluating our overall business and portfolio to ensure Johnson & Johnson remains best positioned to truly lead where healthcare is going.","For our Orthopaedics business, the planned separation creates new opportunities.","And be able to place even greater focus in our investment towards higher growth ideas where we can meaningfully extend and improve lives."],"x":[0,58,39,17,6,6,7,8,8,9,10,11,13,13,13,15,15,18,18,18,20,1,57,38,15,6,6,6,13,13,15,15,16,16,16,16,17,18,18,22,2,52,39,14,0,1,6,9,13,16,16,18,18,19,20,20,22,22,3,48,36,9,6,6,8,13,15,15,15,16,18,4,52,43,11,1,6,7,8,12,13,14,16,17,17,18,5,44,36,9,3,4,14,16,16,18,20,21,22,6,43,34,10,4,6,7,8,9,12,15,17,18,19,7,26,22,6,11,13,15,15,17,18,8,17,16,6,4,6,7,11,18,21,9,22,19,5,4,6,9,11,15,10,28,22,4,3,5,9,20,11,18,17,2,16,22,12,17,16,4,1,7,16,20,13,17,15,1,2,14,18,18,1,16,15,17,13,3,8,17,20,16,16,8,4,5,5,20,20,17,7,7,2,14,15,18,11,9,0,19,16,16,2,7,16,20,17,16,4,1,8,10,15,21,8,8,0,22,8,8,2,12,14,23,13,13,1,2,24,9,8,3,7,15,15,25,5,5,1,13,26,4,4,2,2,18,27,12,12,2,13,18,28,10,9,0,29,10,10,3,14,15,16,30,14,14,2,18,19,31,9,9,1,7,32,8,8,2,4,11,33,8,8,2,6,21,34,7,7,1,20,35,8,8,1,9,36,5,5,1,17,37,5,5,2,3,4,38,2,2,1,18,39,6,6,2,4,17,4